&#x20;       "description": "Owned magic item requiring NO attunement. When worn, grants Advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks relying on sight, increasing passive sight-based Perception from 16 to 21. Also supports clear-visibility long-distance detail observation under the 2024 item rules. Does not grant Darkvision, X-ray vision, or benefits to hearing and smell. Actual current wear state is not independently verified."\
