&#x20;       "name": "Cloak of Displacement",\
&#x20;       "quantity": 1,\
&#x20;       "description": "Owned and attuned magic item. Worn on the anatomical LEFT when dressed. While worn and operative, attacks against Kael have Disadvantage. Taking any damage suppresses the displacement illusion until the start of his next turn. The effect is also suppressed while his Speed is 0. Does not increase AC, grant resistance, or provide invisibility. Actual current wear state and suppression state are scene-dependent."\
&#x20;
            },\
&#x20;     {\
