&#x20;       "description": "Owned and attuned magic item. Worn on the anatomical RIGHT when dressed. While worn, a Magic action manifests wings, granting a 60-ft Fly Speed for up to one hour. Another Magic action can dismiss them early. After they disappear, they cannot manifest again for 1d12 hours. No concentration, hovering, extra attack, or free Action Surge Magic action. Completion, delivery, previous use, ownership, and attunement are confirmed. Current deployment and cooldown state are not established."\
